{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "85128f74-1d48-4014-996a-855181875dd5",
    "name": "Oficina — Fase 4 · Saga da OS",
    "description": "Fluxo completo da saga orquestrada, na ordem: login → abrir OS → diagnóstico → orçamento → aprovação → pagamento → reparo → resultado.\n\nUse com o ambiente `local` (docker-compose.saga.yml) ou `prod` (API Gateway). Rode as pastas em ordem pelo Collection Runner; os passos assíncronos repetem sozinhos (até 20 s) enquanto a saga avança.\n\nCenários de compensação: *Recusar orçamento* (pasta 3), *Pagamento recusado* (pasta 4) ou `prefixo_placa = FAL` (falha no reparo, com estorno).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login — atendente/admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@oficina.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"Admin@123\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_admin\", pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "if (pm.environment.get(\"ambiente\") === \"local\") pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_cliente\", pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — mecânico",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"joao@oficina.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"Mecanico@123\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_mecanico\", pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Token do cliente por CPF (prod — Lambda)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway_url}}/auth/token",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cpf\": \"{{cpf_cliente}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Só em `prod`: o API Gateway encaminha para a Lambda `auth-token`. Localmente não há Lambda — use o token do admin (`token_cliente` já vem igual a `token_admin` no ambiente local) para aprovar o orçamento."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.environment.get(\"ambiente\") === \"local\") { console.log(\"local: sem Lambda — token_cliente = token_admin\"); pm.execution.skipRequest(); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_cliente\", pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Rode primeiro. Os tokens ficam em variáveis da coleção."
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · Atendente abre a OS (T1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/clients",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Cliente Postman\",\n  \"documento\": \"{{cpf_cliente}}\",\n  \"email\": \"postman-{{$randomInt}}@exemplo.com\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// CPF válido aleatório",
                  "const d=[...Array(9)].map(()=>Math.floor(Math.random()*10));",
                  "for (const n of [10,11]) { const s=d.reduce((a,v,i)=>a+v*(n-i),0); const r=(s*10)%11; d.push(r===10?0:r); }",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cpf_cliente', d.join(''));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cliente_id\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar veículo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/vehicles",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cliente_id\": \"{{cliente_id}}\",\n  \"placa\": \"{{placa}}\",\n  \"marca\": \"VW\",\n  \"modelo\": \"Gol\",\n  \"ano\": 2020\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Placa Mercosul aleatória com o prefixo da variável `prefixo_placa` (ABC = normal, FAL = falha simulada no reparo)",
                  "const L='ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ', r=n=>Math.floor(Math.random()*n);",
                  "const p=(pm.variables.get('prefixo_placa')||'ABC')+r(10)+L[r(26)]+String(r(100)).padStart(2,'0');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('placa', p);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"veiculo_id\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar peça (estoque 10)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/parts",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Amortecedor {{$randomInt}}\",\n  \"codigo\": \"PM-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"preco\": 189.9,\n  \"estoque_minimo\": 1,\n  \"estoque_atual\": 10\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"peca_id\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Abrir OS (reserva 2 peças e inicia a saga)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/work-orders",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cliente_id\": \"{{cliente_id}}\",\n  \"veiculo_id\": \"{{veiculo_id}}\",\n  \"descricao\": \"barulho na suspensão\",\n  \"pecas\": [\n    {\n      \"peca_id\": \"{{peca_id}}\",\n      \"quantidade\": 2\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"os_id\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Peça — estoque reservado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/parts/{{peca_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('2 unidades reservadas', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().estoque_reservado).to.eql(2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Mecânico — diagnóstico (T2, Execution)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Fila de diagnóstico",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/fila?tipo=DIAGNOSTICO",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tarefas da OS → tarefa de diagnóstico",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas?os_id={{os_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const t = pm.response.json().find(x => x.tipo === 'DIAGNOSTICO');",
                  "const n = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_tentativas\") || 0);",
                  "if (!(t) && n < 20) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", n + 1);",
                  "  console.log(\"aguardando a saga: tarefa de diagnóstico (\" + (n + 1) + \"/20)\");",
                  "  setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", 0);",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tarefa_diagnostico_id\", t.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar diagnóstico",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas/{{tarefa_diagnostico_id}}/iniciar",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Concluir diagnóstico",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas/{{tarefa_diagnostico_id}}/concluir-diagnostico",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"diagnostico\": \"amortecedor dianteiro vazando\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Cliente — orçamento (T3/T4, Billing)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Orçamento da OS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{billing_url}}/billing/v1/orcamentos?os_id={{os_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_cliente}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const n = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_tentativas\") || 0);",
                  "if (!(pm.response.code === 200) && n < 20) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", n + 1);",
                  "  console.log(\"aguardando a saga: orçamento (\" + (n + 1) + \"/20)\");",
                  "  setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", 0);",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orcamento_id\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Aprovar orçamento → link do Mercado Pago",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{billing_url}}/billing/v1/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/aprovar",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_cliente}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Em `prod`, abra `{{link_pagamento}}` no navegador e pague no sandbox (cartão de teste, titular `APRO`). Localmente, use a pasta 4."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"mp_order_id\", pm.response.json().pagamento.mp_order_id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"link_pagamento\", pm.response.json().pagamento.link_pagamento);",
                  "console.log(\"Pague em: \" + pm.response.json().pagamento.link_pagamento);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Pagamento (T5) — stub local",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pagar (stub: processed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{mp_stub_url}}/_stub/pagar",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{mp_order_id}}\",\n  \"resultado\": \"processed\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Só local: o stub do Mercado Pago marca a order como paga; o reconciliador do Billing confirma em até 10 s."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar a order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{mp_stub_url}}/v1/orders/{{mp_order_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Em `prod`, pule esta pasta e pague pelo link do Checkout Pro."
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · Mecânico — reparo (T6 pivô / T7, Execution)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tarefas da OS → tarefa de reparo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas?os_id={{os_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const t = pm.response.json().find(x => x.tipo === 'REPARO' && x.estado !== 'CANCELADA');",
                  "const n = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_tentativas\") || 0);",
                  "if (!(t) && n < 20) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", n + 1);",
                  "  console.log(\"aguardando a saga: tarefa de reparo (pagamento confirmado?) (\" + (n + 1) + \"/20)\");",
                  "  setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", 0);",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tarefa_reparo_id\", t.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar reparo (pivô: baixa do estoque)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas/{{tarefa_reparo_id}}/iniciar",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Concluir reparo → OS finalizada",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{execution_url}}/execution/v1/tarefas/{{tarefa_reparo_id}}/concluir",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_mecanico}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Com `prefixo_placa = FAL` (e `PERMITIR_FALHA_SIMULADA=true` no Execution) a tarefa de reparo não é criada: a saga estorna o pagamento e compensa tudo."
    },
    {
      "name": "6 · Resultado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Status da OS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/work-orders/{{os_id}}/status",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const s = pm.response.json().status;",
                  "const n = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_tentativas\") || 0);",
                  "if (![\"finalizada\",\"cancelada\",\"entregue\"].includes(s) && n < 20) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", n + 1);",
                  "  console.log(\"aguardando a saga terminar: \" + s + \" (\" + (n + 1) + \"/20)\");",
                  "  setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_tentativas\", 0);",
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log(\"status final: \" + s);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "OS completa",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{os_url}}/v1/work-orders/{{os_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_admin}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
